--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library provides the NVWarp360 image and coordinate warping engine used for
dewarping 360 degree and fisheye camera input. It supports the perspective,
panoramic, fisheye and cubemap warp types, multi-warp batching and forward and
reverse coordinate transforms, and is the backend used by the nvdewarper plugin.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ Set CUDA_VER in the MakeFile as per platform.
  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvds_dewarper.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
How to test:
Refer to the sample application
sources/apps/sample_apps/deepstream-dewarper-test for a reference usage.
